Responsible (R): Credit Analyst
Accountable (A): Credit Manager
Duration: per unit</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5382_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5382_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5382_Task6" name="Match the sold unit to the funded collateral (W5379); compute the curtailment…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Match the sold unit to the funded collateral (W5379); compute the curtailment (principal + accrued interest) due.
Responsible (R): Credit Analyst
Accountable (A): Credit Manager
Duration: per unit</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5382_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5382_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
