Responsible (R): Credit Analyst
Accountable (A): Credit Manager
Duration: daily</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5382_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5382_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
